put.description:
Update transcript with user edits

Accepts both formats:
1. Standard: {"segments": [...], "edit_notes": "..."}
2. Frontend nested: {"transcript": {"segments": [...], ...}, "edit_notes": "..."}

SimpleGenerateRequest.description:
Request for simple mode generation - generate complete song from natural language.

The LM will generate caption, lyrics, and all metadata from your query.

Example:
{
    "query": "a soft Bengali love song for a quiet evening"
}
